      "writtenOn": "2025-10-16T21:51:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I know we need this, but it makes me nervous from a security perspective.\n\nCan we design some sort of authentication mechanism or something along those lines?",
      "revId": "ddb659b77b509f1784072da1a6becec4390e2789",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
